        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Essence:</strong> Death &middot; <strong>Mutation:</strong> Carrion Bloom</p><p><em>Fossilised organic matter &mdash; which is what the symbiont is doing to you, slowly.</em></p><table><thead><tr><th>Depth</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Your Strikes may deal <strong>void</strong>. +1 item bonus to saves against death effects.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><strong>+1d4 void.</strong> Gain <strong>2 temporary Hit Points</strong> when you reduce a creature to 0 Hit Points.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><strong>+1d6 void.</strong> A creature you kill cannot be returned to life by magic below 6th rank.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><strong>+1d6 void.</strong> Once per day, a creature within 30 feet at or below half Hit Points must succeed at a Fortitude save against your class DC or take <strong>void damage equal to twice your level</strong>.</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Depth is this effect's badge. The whole Mutation switches off at Depth 3+ while the Carapace is broken.</em></p>"
